  "4:25": "And great crowds followed him from Galilee, and from Decapolis, and from Jerusalem, and from Judea, and from beyond the Jordan.",
  "5:1": "And seeing the crowds, he went up a mountain; and when he had sat down, his disciples came to him.",
  "5:5": "Blessed are those who mourn: for they shall be comforted.",
