  "5:25": "Come to terms quickly with your adversary while you are on the way with him, so that the adversary may not hand you over to the judge, and the judge hand you over to the officer, and you be thrown into prison.",
  "5:26": "Amen I say to you, you shall not get out of there until you have paid the last farthing.",
  "5:27": "You have heard that it was said to the people of old: You shall not commit adultery.",
