  "5:33": "Again, you have heard that it was said to the people of old: You shall not swear falsely, but you shall fulfill your oaths to the Lord.",
  "5:34": "But I say to you not to swear at all: neither by heaven, for it is the throne of God,",
  "5:37": "But let your speech be: Yes, yes; No, no. Anything more than these is from evil.",
