  "8:9": "For I also am a man under authority, with soldiers under me; and I say to this one: Go, and he goes; and to another: Come, and he comes; and to my servant: Do this, and he does it.",
  "8:10": "And when Jesus heard this, he marveled, and said to those who followed him: Amen I say to you, I have not found such great faith in Israel.",
  "8:11": "And I say to you that many shall come from the east and the west, and shall sit down with Abraham and Isaac and Jacob in the kingdom of heaven;",
