  "8:18": "And Jesus, seeing great crowds around him, gave orders to cross over the water.",
  "8:19": "And a scribe came and said to him: Master, I will follow you wherever you go.",
  "8:20": "And Jesus says to him: The foxes have holes, and the birds of the air have nests; but the Son of man has nowhere to lay his head.",
  "8:21": "And another of his disciples said to him: Lord, let me first go and bury my father.",
  "8:23": "And when he got into the boat, his disciples followed him.",
